{"id":"de6579e3-8615-4fc2-afa4-408731eaf35c","revision":0,"last_node_id":102,"last_link_id":296,"nodes":[{"id":78,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2886.984697327571,-1015.5317509931991],"size":[248.05415729143579,123.07715040845221],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Masking","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["If you don't see a white box in the preview mask node that means that your model didn't detect the area, make sure you have the right model selected for what you're trying to do\n\nFor instance if there's only one eye visible in the image and you try to use the Eyeful_v2-Paired.pt detector sometimes it won't register"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":71,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[3173.7594744156654,-977.4765885821191],"size":[261.8424808327186,88],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Saving","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["When you get a good result, right click on the right \"Preview Image\" node and click \"Save Image\"\n\nNote: you will likely need to cycle through different seeds before you get a result you're satisfied with"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":74,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-49.30137201078171,-1018.9418166158641],"size":[309.4783099583176,127.19993759389854],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Checkpoint","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Choose your model here - I chose Wai Illustrious because that's what I normally use, but you can choose any checkpoint you want\n\nIf using an inpainting model you MUST enable the inpainting_model setting on the face detailer node\n\nIf using an inpainting model, I recommend Waifu Inpaint by ShinoharaHare on Hugging Face: [Download Here](https://huggingface.co/ShinoharaHare/Waifu-Inpaint-XL)\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":72,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[393.16393365737446,-1017.3131267303067],"size":[286.24665810596935,104.41621110667973],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"LoRAs","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Add your LoRAs here\n\nIf detailing an image depicting a specific character I HIGHLY recommend using a character LoRA for your character here to ensure maximum accuracy\n\nSame goes for styles if you have a LoRA for it"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":75,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[875.1627055249007,-1085.8936539131741],"size":[313.4756645507457,181.83025713485335],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Prompting","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["For prompting I recommend keeping it highly simplistic, i.e. if the character has green eyes simply just put \"green eyes\" in the positive prompt, if you want to change the facial expression to a smile just put \"smile\", etc.\n\nIf you're using a character LoRA make sure you include the trigger plus your character's eye color, alternatively you can just include the trigger\n\nI find better results when I don't include any negative prompts unless there's something blatant in the image that I want to remove, the amount of steps used in the face detailer is low so too many prompts can cause it to blow up"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":69,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1643.5474953109558,-665.8465221571056],"size":[367.58244661393724,194.4286156798603],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Detection Models","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Face -> bbox/face_yolov8m.pt (included with impact subpack)\n\nBoth eyes -> bbox/Eyeful_v2-Paired.pt\n[Download Here](https://civitai.com/models/178518/eyeful-or-robust-eye-detection-for-adetailer-comfyui)\n\nOne eye -> bbox/eyes.pt (included with impact subpack)\n\nHands -> bbox/hand_yolov8s.pt (included with impact subpack)\n\nFeet -> bbox/adetailerFootYolov8x_v20.pt [Download Here](https://civitai.com/models/257904/adetailer-footyolov8xpt)\n\nTo add downloaded models, go to .../ComfyUI/models/ultralytics/bbox\n\nI do NOT recommend using a sam model or segm detector, they just end up either not capturing the area properly or making the end result markedly worse\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":4,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[-50.79146806992886,-828.3536101774201],"size":[315,98],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"ckpt_name","name":"ckpt_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ckpt_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[254]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":1,"links":[249,250,255]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":2,"links":[221]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","models":[{"name":"v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-diffusion-v1-5-archive/resolve/main/v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors?download=true","directory":"checkpoints"}],"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"ckpt_name":true},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["waiIllustriousSDXL_v170.safetensors"]},{"id":50,"type":"FromBasicPipe","pos":[2172.292598234112,-847.3224903033804],"size":[154.294921875,106],"flags":{},"order":26,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"basic_pipe","name":"basic_pipe","type":"BASIC_PIPE","link":222}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","links":[276]},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","links":[277]},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","links":[278]},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[279]},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[280]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FromBasicPipe","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":49,"type":"ToBasicPipe","pos":[1375.8054373917648,-840.8019354413973],"size":[154.294921875,106],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":256},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":257},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":221},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":219},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":220}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"basic_pipe","name":"basic_pipe","type":"BASIC_PIPE","links":[222,282]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ToBasicPipe","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":95,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[3161.386982629762,269.63723736376045],"size":[140,246],"flags":{},"order":33,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":293}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.5.2"}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":94,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[2977.7772562703476,268.4485954232052],"size":[140,246],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":294}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.5.2"}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":100,"type":"Note","pos":[1736.3811069233636,511.09191857096135],"size":[300.0607807768306,166.1327510719907],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":4,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"MASK to SEGS","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Important functionalities ->\n\nbbox_fill: will force the masked area into a uniform rectangular shape, disable if the area you're masking requires precise area selection\n\ncontour_fill: fills in any gaps according to the mask structure you selected, but may extend the area slightly\n\nIn 99 percent of scenarios I found enabling bbox_fill was best"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":77,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1974.2814531386132,-1188.8481406049511],"size":[398.4678236348352,238.9840903275109],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Dependencies","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["You will need:\n\nComfyUI-Impact-Pack\n\nComfyUI-Impact-Subpack\n\nrgthree\n\n\nI HIGHLY recommend installing these through Comfy Manager, however you can install them manually here:\n\n[ComfyUI-Impact-Pack](https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack)\n\n[ComfyUI-Impact-Subpack](https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Subpack)\n\n[rgthree](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":97,"type":"MaskPreview","pos":[2782.485704262131,270.90237766525973],"size":[140,246],"flags":{},"order":28,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"mask","name":"mask","type":"MASK","link":292}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MaskPreview","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.7"}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":96,"type":"SegsToCombinedMask","pos":[2757.732366152484,571.8566273423887],"size":[217.7505859375,26],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"segs","name":"segs","type":"SEGS","link":291}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MASK","name":"MASK","type":"MASK","links":[292]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SegsToCombinedMask","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.7"}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":76,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2424.1070674450602,-1213.6111097446355],"size":[370.52659885219146,256.58706848903375],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Settings","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["I do not recommend adjusting any of the settings, after extensive research and testing I found these settings to be the best for pretty much every situation\n\nYou can try switching the sampler if desired, i.e. for realistic images you might want to change the sampler to karras, although I haven't tested any other samplers so you may need to adjust the steps/cfg\n\nIf using an inpainting model change the inpainting_mode setting from disabled to enabled\n\nI do not recommend touching the denoise or bbox_crop_factor settings under most circumstances as putting them higher can cause your image to blow up\n\nIf the image isn't changing enough you can raise the denoise (higher denoise = more significant changes but less original image fidelity) \n\nThe reason the settings are as they are is due to the face detailer modifying small areas, so you don't need to go crazy with the settings"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":102,"type":"Note","pos":[2993.781931462864,556.5398892742812],"size":[327.1073994906433,132.0678306937874],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":4,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Result","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["If result doesn't match what you expected, try these steps in order:\n\n-look at the preview mask node and make sure the mask is actually masking the correct area\n-go back to mask editor and extend the area\n-raise the denoise value (higher denoise = more significant changes but less original image fidelity)\n-raise the steps/cfg (not recommended)"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":90,"type":"FromBasicPipe","pos":[2130.2734056996974,336.4330077926178],"size":[154.294921875,106],"flags":{},"order":27,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"basic_pipe","name":"basic_pipe","type":"BASIC_PIPE","link":282}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","links":[283]},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","links":[284]},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","links":[285]},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[286]},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[287]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FromBasicPipe","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.7"}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":101,"type":"Note","pos":[1380.146207842443,-680.8184463581757],"size":[210,88],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Bypasser","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Enable/disable automatic and manual detection here"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":91,"type":"DetailerForEachDebug","pos":[2345.380492986378,295.82776041907044],"size":[400,680],"flags":{},"order":30,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":290},{"localized_name":"segs","name":"segs","type":"SEGS","link":289},{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":283},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":284},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":285},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":286},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":287},{"localized_name":"detailer_hook","name":"detailer_ho